APEX MATERIALS RISK DETAILS:
- Financial: B- credit rating, declining revenue (20% drop), 30% workforce reduction
- SPOF: Single Cleveland facility, no backup, fire vulnerability demonstrated
- Delivery: 6.25% on-time rate, systemic capacity issues, chronic delays
- Quality: 2.8% defect rate, subcontractor quality problems, premature part failures
- Communication: Account manager turnover (3 in 2 years), no 24/7 support, late notifications
- Scalability: Operating beyond capacity, cannot meet current demand, let alone growth
- Geographic: Single location in weather-prone region, single carrier
- Regulatory: ISO certification may have lapsed, audit findings pending
- Contractual: Weak SLA terms, broad force majeure, insufficient penalties
- Sub-supplier: Heavy reliance on unnamed subcontractors with quality issues


